### 1. Register (run this one TWICE: gives TNO 102, then 103)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todo/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sample Title",
  "writer": "user1",
  "dueDate": "2023-10-10"
}

### 2. List
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todo/list?page=1&size=10

### 3. Read one
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todo/103

### 4. Modify
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todo/103
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "complete": true,
  "dueDate": "2023-05-05"
}

### 5. Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todo/103